policy:
• All villa rates quoted are based on a maximum occupancy of two adults and 1 child per bedroom. Extra Guest charge of USD 71 /per adult/ night.
• Guests aged 13 years and older are considered adults.
• A maximum of 2 additional children under the age of 3 per bedroom.
• Baby cots are available at no cost for children under the age of 3 years.
• Extra Guest charge of USD 35 per child / night charged for children aged 4 to 12 years old.

• A security deposit (the amount dependent on room type booked) will be collected on arrival by the property. This security deposit will be refunded upon departure, less any outstanding charges or damages incurred during your stay. The security deposit amount that will be collected on arrival, are as follows:
(1) 1 Bedroom: US$ 760; 
(2) 2 Bedroom: US$ 910;
(3) 3 Bedroom: US$ 1210;
(4) 4 Bedroom: US$ 1515;
(5) 4 Bedroom Plus: US$ 1820;
(6) 5 Bedroom: US$ 1820;
(7) 5 Bedroom Plus: US$ 2120; 
(8) 6 Bedroom Plus: US$ 2425; 
(9) 7 Bedroom Plus: US$ 2728; 
(10) 8 Bedroom Plus: US$ 3030

• Eligible Plus reservations: Credits and discounts will be applied at check-out in local currency unless otherwise noted. Credits are valid toward incidentals only and will be forfeited if not used.

• Cribs are available for infants under 0-2 years old free of charge.
• Extra beds are available at the following prices:&lt;br&gt;
- Adults (12 years &amp; above): USD 60 per adult, per night (including breakfast)&lt;br&gt;
- Child: USD 30 per adult, per night (including breakfast)&lt;br&gt;
• Eligible Plus reservations: Food and beverage credit applicable towards breakfast and drinks at the hotel bar. Credit will be applied at check-out.
• Eligible Plus reservations: Spa credit applied at check-out and valid towards treatments only unless otherwise noted.
• Eligible Plus reservations: Welcome amenities may be delivered to your room after you check in. A “Do Not Disturb” status may impact the delivery of these amenities.
